{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, let \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c1bb156cd134750185693ab3904a6a03d43c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) =\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}\\log_{8}{n}, &amp;\\text{if }\\log_{8}{n}\\text{ is rational,}\\\\ 0, &amp;\\text{otherwise.}\\end{matrix}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"285\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/5/095360a641378f04d21052472969da5c6699d495.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n = 1}^{1997}{f(n)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"64\" height=\"50\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda450ff1239ee1f0f792eae6cd3f05e1ffba5d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\log_{8}{2047}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{55}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{58}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 585$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"460\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20ac4625e1a7c97573af4cb4203755c44832282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> is rational if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776939957eb5972a7febd68b21f0788c99943f06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^k$\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> for an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.  That's because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934ef9f0144aa89b5ef3d2d57d64e103b69418b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 2^k = k\\log_8 2 = \\frac{k}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"168\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>So we actually want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1cd1efa73599444c41f0998aff05a95e0afdcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{10} \\log_8 2^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"78\" height=\"50\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e9941b625a48e365712bf65ba68733c85b13f484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{11}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> will be over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/23147b3b09df168d7d43748bc192b9f8b09f5188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1997$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Using log properties, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c61acd1dde36b3e5d388db950e27b9fb480e7b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{10} k \\log_8 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"84\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebd9fa436b2a615a935cdcf8cd4e112d2423372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\sum_{k=0}^{10} k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"54\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b388c4a9480792084e172078abcbbd5dccb35929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot (\\frac{10\\cdot 11}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca06297642f4b3810dd3812c8a8fa1f93ad7be98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{55}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><